{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50497","headline":"一○九 · 王梵志","name":"一○九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城外土馒头，馅草在城里。\n一人吃一个，莫嫌没滋味。\n（此诗又见《冷斋夜话》卷十、《苕溪渔隐丛话前集》卷五六、《诗话总龟》卷三九引《东坡诗话》、《云卧纪谭》等书。\n）（以上二首黄庭坚引梵志诗。\n）（〖1〗案以上诸诗，郑振铎辑本并收之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}